sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Itaú
  participant GW as Payment Gateway
  participant M as Merchant

  B->>GW: webhook: Pix received (mTLS)
  GW-->>B: 202 (stored, processed later)
  GW->>B: confirm charge status
  B-->>GW: paid, amount, e2eid
  GW->>GW: COMPLETED + outbox event
  GW-)M: webhook payment.completed
  Note over GW: Backstops without the webhook:<br/>expiration asks the bank · reconciliation every 15 min
